WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:48.447 --> 00:00:49.052
Please come.

00:00:53.610 --> 00:00:54.209
Come sit.

00:01:00.423 --> 00:01:01.386
Will you have something?

00:01:01.983 --> 00:01:02.939
No, thank you.

00:01:05.558 --> 00:01:06.430
Greetings.

00:01:06.454 --> 00:01:07.509
Greetings.

00:01:08.990 --> 00:01:11.196
Ma'am, this is Rania's father?

00:01:13.312 --> 00:01:15.150
I will bring tea for you guys.

00:01:30.621 --> 00:01:33.221
So you are Rania's father?

00:01:34.770 --> 00:01:35.930
And you are Raja's mother?

00:01:38.734 --> 00:01:39.147
Yes.

00:01:40.638 --> 00:01:43.314
The same Raja that you had accused of
theft.

00:01:46.542 --> 00:01:51.034
And today he has proved that he is a
dishonest man.

00:01:54.875 --> 00:01:56.827
You should not talk about honesty.

00:01:58.429 --> 00:02:01.168
Because honesty starts with justice.

00:02:02.327 --> 00:02:02.727
And...

00:02:04.559 --> 00:02:08.012
you did not do justice to your two
children.

00:02:09.001 --> 00:02:10.430
I spoke to Rania.

00:02:15.811 --> 00:02:17.925
That is why you should talk about work.

00:02:17.950 --> 00:02:19.050
Why are you really here?

00:02:20.170 --> 00:02:21.793
Raja is confusing Rania.

00:02:23.672 --> 00:02:25.508
Rania is engaged to Adil.

00:02:25.990 --> 00:02:27.310
they are about to get married.

00:02:29.288 --> 00:02:33.210
Tell Raja not to play with fire.

00:02:37.590 --> 00:02:39.667
Raja is my only son.

00:02:41.756 --> 00:02:44.525
When he was accused
of theft, I did not go

00:02:44.526 --> 00:02:48.991
to the police station
nor did I bail him out.

00:02:50.973 --> 00:02:54.056
In fact, I kicked him out of the house.

00:02:57.390 --> 00:02:59.975
I met Rania and called her home.

00:03:01.413 --> 00:03:05.863
I decided to support them after knowing of their willingness.

00:03:13.426 --> 00:03:15.128
And I did not just decide.

00:03:21.906 --> 00:03:22.565
Saira.

00:03:23.480 --> 00:03:23.863
Yes.

00:03:26.001 --> 00:03:26.704
Come here, child.

00:03:27.840 --> 00:03:28.309
Yes, mother.

00:03:35.631 --> 00:03:40.529
I have called my daughter and made her sit
at home.

00:03:44.625 --> 00:03:46.241
My son is on the right track.

00:03:49.404 --> 00:03:51.995
You complained about him to the wrong
person.

00:04:02.808 --> 00:04:03.294
Goodbye.

00:04:27.516 --> 00:04:27.860
Yes.

00:04:28.057 --> 00:04:29.179
I have been ringing the bell for a long
time.

00:04:29.500 --> 00:04:30.500
Call Rania madam.

00:04:31.080 --> 00:04:32.947
You are not allowed to meet Rania madam.

00:04:33.850 --> 00:04:35.334
What cheap drugs have you used?

00:04:35.720 --> 00:04:37.637
You are telling me that I am not allowed
to meet her?

00:04:37.800 --> 00:04:38.974
Go and tell her that Raja is there.

00:04:39.199 --> 00:04:40.030
easy.

00:04:40.212 --> 00:04:41.145
I will get rid of your intoxication.

00:04:41.521 --> 00:04:43.100
You cannot meet Rania madam.

00:04:43.130 --> 00:04:44.240
This is an order.

00:04:44.320 --> 00:04:44.740
This is an order.

00:04:44.780 --> 00:04:45.780
You have gone mad.

00:04:46.080 --> 00:04:48.080
Tell me what I should do and what I should
not do.

00:04:48.360 --> 00:04:49.640
Go and tell her who has come.

00:04:49.680 --> 00:04:50.960
You will understand it yourself.

00:04:51.160 --> 00:04:52.505
Don't create a scene again.

00:04:53.576 --> 00:04:55.216
I have been with madam for 7-8 hours.

00:04:55.240 --> 00:04:56.240
I don't need to tell her.

00:04:56.340 --> 00:04:56.660
Do you understand?

00:04:57.160 --> 00:04:57.940
This is an order.

00:04:57.980 --> 00:04:58.620
You are not allowed to meet her.

00:04:58.640 --> 00:04:59.500
This is not an order.

00:04:59.580 --> 00:05:00.580
Wait.

00:05:04.100 --> 00:05:04.800
I will call her right now.

00:05:04.900 --> 00:05:06.260
I have come to teach you a lesson.

00:05:09.980 --> 00:05:11.730
What kind of a scene is this?

00:05:11.755 --> 00:05:12.300
They are not letting me in.

00:05:12.301 --> 00:05:12.640
They are not letting me in.

00:05:14.103 --> 00:05:14.865
Come out.

00:05:16.760 --> 00:05:17.180
Let's go.

00:05:17.440 --> 00:05:17.998
Don't touch me.

00:05:18.165 --> 00:05:18.605
Don't touch me.

00:05:18.740 --> 00:05:19.100
Leave me.

00:05:19.420 --> 00:05:20.420
What is going on?

00:05:22.493 --> 00:05:24.224
What is going on?

00:05:25.547 --> 00:05:27.027
I had come to pick up Rania madam.

00:05:27.800 --> 00:05:28.880
They are not letting me in.

00:05:31.818 --> 00:05:32.998
She is not at home.

00:05:33.400 --> 00:05:34.400
Come tomorrow.

00:05:34.480 --> 00:05:35.480
Now go.

00:05:35.700 --> 00:05:36.980
I just spoke to her on the call.

00:05:37.620 --> 00:05:38.260
I know everything.

00:05:38.300 --> 00:05:38.860
She is at home.

00:05:39.080 --> 00:05:40.200
Why are you lying to me?

00:05:40.280 --> 00:05:41.280
Hey!

00:05:43.046 --> 00:05:44.950
You have made no use of our respect.

00:05:45.700 --> 00:05:47.316
Otherwise you will not be able to go to
your parents.

00:05:47.340 --> 00:05:48.380
Hit him and throw him out.

00:05:50.072 --> 00:05:51.072
Raja!

00:07:51.084 --> 00:07:52.109
Hello, Raja are you alright?

00:07:53.345 --> 00:07:55.180
Are you hurt?

00:07:56.970 --> 00:07:58.650
What have you done Rania?

00:07:59.846 --> 00:08:02.046
What was the need to tell your father
about us?

00:08:02.070 --> 00:08:03.310
You have ruined the whole plan.

00:08:04.545 --> 00:08:06.270
Raja, I am so sorry.

00:08:07.310 --> 00:08:08.630
You were facing everything alone.

00:08:08.870 --> 00:08:11.879
I thought that if I would
talk to father and he

00:08:11.880 --> 00:08:15.011
would understand then
it would be so easy for us.

00:08:16.970 --> 00:08:18.610
But now I have understood.

00:08:19.530 --> 00:08:21.290
I know how my family is.

00:08:21.530 --> 00:08:23.991
Now you... Now you tell
me what to do and I will do that.

00:08:25.390 --> 00:08:27.542
Don't try this again Rania.

00:08:28.150 --> 00:08:29.310
I know.

00:08:30.050 --> 00:08:31.570
I just wanted to take one more chance.

00:08:33.070 --> 00:08:34.601
Why are you crying?

00:08:36.030 --> 00:08:37.190
I have spoken to Bablu.

00:08:37.250 --> 00:08:39.990
He is saying that we have to give him the
marriage papers.

00:08:40.650 --> 00:08:42.050
After that everything will be done.

00:08:42.989 --> 00:08:44.950
Raja, father will not let me go.

00:08:46.370 --> 00:08:47.670
What will we do?

00:08:49.935 --> 00:08:50.970
I will tell you.

00:08:51.487 --> 00:08:53.145
Give me some time.

00:08:53.170 --> 00:08:53.570
I will tell you something.

00:08:54.130 --> 00:08:54.610
We will do something.

00:08:54.611 --> 00:08:55.611
We will find a solution.

00:08:56.070 --> 00:08:57.070
Okay.

00:09:20.827 --> 00:09:21.313
Saira.

00:09:22.976 --> 00:09:24.161
Did Amir call?

00:09:25.989 --> 00:09:27.020
No mother.

00:09:28.635 --> 00:09:30.580
After that day, he didn't call once.

00:09:36.368 --> 00:09:39.320
Im sure Naheed is upto something.

00:09:44.205 --> 00:09:45.703
I saw uncle.

00:09:46.037 --> 00:09:46.239
What?

00:09:48.472 --> 00:09:48.702
When?

00:09:51.622 --> 00:09:51.992
Yesterday.

00:09:53.650 --> 00:09:55.050
They were going towards the mosque.

00:09:58.738 --> 00:09:59.633
Did you greet them?

00:10:04.386 --> 00:10:05.190
Did they answer them?

00:10:08.069 --> 00:10:11.158
As soon as they heard my greetings,
they ran towards the mosque.

00:10:14.010 --> 00:10:19.265
Your uncle... He spent his
whole life scared of your aunt.

00:10:19.290 --> 00:10:21.501
He didn't have any wishes or opinions 
of his own.

00:10:25.847 --> 00:10:26.121
Come on.

00:10:28.997 --> 00:10:29.546
Take this.

00:10:29.752 --> 00:10:30.794
Keep it in the kitchen.

00:10:30.862 --> 00:10:31.846
I am coming.

00:10:33.335 --> 00:10:34.158
Oh God.

00:10:48.662 --> 00:10:49.626
Hey... What happened?

00:10:50.895 --> 00:10:54.532
Saira... Saira... Get up.

00:10:55.726 --> 00:10:56.819
How much was the amount of rightful
money? 

00:10:58.959 --> 00:11:00.341
It was according to religion

00:11:00.365 --> 00:11:01.054
Okay.

00:11:02.220 --> 00:11:03.340
Give me your ID card.

00:11:22.507 --> 00:11:23.712
When did you get married?

00:11:24.784 --> 00:11:25.784
Yes, that...

00:11:31.058 --> 00:11:33.518
This is the marriage contract.

00:11:34.053 --> 00:11:34.648
Ours.

00:11:41.765 --> 00:11:44.625
It has not even been that long since
you guys got married.

00:11:45.701 --> 00:11:46.869
Two months with difficulty.

00:11:47.470 --> 00:11:48.830
And you are going towards divorce.

00:11:50.731 --> 00:11:54.560
I don't know... What are the
differences between you and your wife.

00:11:55.350 --> 00:11:57.694
Still... I advise you...

00:11:58.255 --> 00:12:00.566
to rethink your decision.

00:12:03.307 --> 00:12:05.027
Saira should get her first divorce
tomorrow.

00:12:05.705 --> 00:12:06.194
Understood?

00:12:08.314 --> 00:12:10.081
Please prepare the papers.

00:12:12.718 --> 00:12:13.261
Okay.

00:12:14.136 --> 00:12:15.136
As you wish.

00:12:35.214 --> 00:12:36.734
What happened to my child?

00:12:37.212 --> 00:12:38.736
There is nothing to worry about.

00:12:38.870 --> 00:12:40.423
In fact, this is good news for you.

00:12:41.892 --> 00:12:43.012
Good news?

00:12:43.047 --> 00:12:44.425
Your daughter is about to be
a mother .

00:12:47.067 --> 00:12:48.121
Really?

00:12:49.507 --> 00:12:51.309
It's just minor weaknesses.

00:12:51.334 --> 00:12:53.236
And I have given her some vitamins.

00:12:54.949 --> 00:12:58.878
But you should meet Dr. Farkhanda tomorrow
at 7pm.

00:12:59.663 --> 00:13:01.243
I will definitely meet her.

00:13:01.532 --> 00:13:03.838
You said Dr. Farkhanda, right?

00:13:03.989 --> 00:13:04.705
God willing.

00:13:05.297 --> 00:13:06.621
Thank you very much.

00:13:06.645 --> 00:13:07.270
God bless you.

00:13:07.294 --> 00:13:08.863
You gave me such good news.

00:13:09.345 --> 00:13:11.405
Guddu... Go and
drop her downstairs.

00:13:11.910 --> 00:13:12.594
Hold  the bag.

00:13:22.430 --> 00:13:23.145
Did you see?

00:13:23.658 --> 00:13:25.901
I told you that everything will be fine.

00:13:26.410 --> 00:13:27.752
Why do you worry?

00:13:28.835 --> 00:13:30.321
God will make everything right.

00:13:35.684 --> 00:13:36.546
Yes, mom.

00:13:39.741 --> 00:13:44.261
But... If Aamir really
gives me a divorce...

00:13:46.872 --> 00:13:51.138
How will I spend my life with this child
alone?

00:13:53.065 --> 00:13:55.723
The one who gives birth also writes down
his fate.

00:13:57.361 --> 00:13:58.549
So don't worry.

00:13:59.476 --> 00:14:01.429
God is the master of everything.

00:14:06.516 --> 00:14:06.898
Come on.

00:14:07.105 --> 00:14:08.365
Don't worry too much.

00:14:08.389 --> 00:14:08.928
Don't think.

00:14:09.360 --> 00:14:11.497
I will go and get these medicines.

00:14:27.711 --> 00:14:30.410
Amir brother, congratulations.

00:14:30.435 --> 00:14:32.035
At least give me sweets.

00:14:33.511 --> 00:14:34.511
In what happiness?

00:14:36.255 --> 00:14:39.228
According to happiness, we should have
a meal.

00:14:39.253 --> 00:14:41.133
But you got married to Saira.

00:14:41.360 --> 00:14:42.846
That is why I am happy.

00:14:43.693 --> 00:14:45.955
Did Raja get married to Rania?

00:14:45.980 --> 00:14:47.420
Oh no, brother.

00:14:48.488 --> 00:14:49.995
You are going to be a father.

00:14:50.019 --> 00:14:51.775
Father.

00:14:51.800 --> 00:14:53.173
Give me sweets.

00:14:53.960 --> 00:14:54.651
No problem.

00:14:54.880 --> 00:14:55.471
No problem.

00:14:55.652 --> 00:14:57.406
I will take money from Raja's wallet.

00:14:57.431 --> 00:14:59.026
You can settle accounts with him.

00:14:59.340 --> 00:15:00.122
Wow.

00:15:00.300 --> 00:15:01.095
You are going to be a father.

00:15:01.120 --> 00:15:01.620
And you don't know.

00:15:01.826 --> 00:15:03.128
Person unbothered, witnesses more eager.

00:15:03.344 --> 00:15:03.916
Come on.

00:15:03.940 --> 00:15:05.051
Let us get sweets.

00:15:53.113 --> 00:15:55.559
That boy will not understand so easily.

00:15:57.584 --> 00:15:59.117
Because Rania is also supporting him.

00:16:06.582 --> 00:16:11.006
In Adil's absence, we can pressurize
Rania.

00:16:12.239 --> 00:16:17.091
And if Adil comes, then this opportunity
will also go away from us.

00:16:19.120 --> 00:16:22.595
By the way, Rania has not spoken to Adil
yet.

00:16:24.440 --> 00:16:26.002
She cannot even talk.

00:16:27.908 --> 00:16:30.539
She knows that Adil will get Raja 
picked up overnight.

00:16:31.375 --> 00:16:32.246
That is what I am saying.

00:16:33.875 --> 00:16:34.697
What do you mean?

00:16:35.080 --> 00:16:36.160
Should we get Raja picked?

00:16:37.886 --> 00:16:38.464
No.

00:16:39.228 --> 00:16:39.744
Listen.

00:16:41.128 --> 00:16:44.668
You go to Rania and tell her that you are
going to talk to Adil.

00:16:46.015 --> 00:16:49.151
Rania will definitely listen to you to
save Raja's life.

00:16:49.822 --> 00:16:53.988
And then, you go to Sultan house
and nudge the wedding talks.

00:16:55.220 --> 00:17:02.322
And as soon as the wedding is fixed,
Adil will deal with Raja himself.

00:17:20.676 --> 00:17:21.516
Take it away.

00:17:22.302 --> 00:17:23.190
I don't want to eat.

00:17:24.567 --> 00:17:26.095
You haven't eaten anything since last
night.

00:17:26.119 --> 00:17:27.119
Eat a little.

00:17:27.440 --> 00:17:29.213
Otherwise, you will fall sick.

00:17:29.557 --> 00:17:31.397
Sister Sajida, what am I telling you?

00:17:32.096 --> 00:17:32.856
Take it away.

00:17:32.880 --> 00:17:33.582
I don't want to eat.

00:17:35.440 --> 00:17:36.684
Sajida, leave it here.

00:17:37.420 --> 00:17:37.891
Yes.

00:17:47.708 --> 00:17:49.128
What is this hunger strike for?

00:17:49.610 --> 00:17:51.610
You people are being very cruel to me,
father.

00:17:52.554 --> 00:17:54.574
You are being cruel to yourself.

00:17:55.787 --> 00:17:57.274
And you don't even know about it.

00:17:59.890 --> 00:18:01.941
Father, I don't want to marry Adil.

00:18:02.932 --> 00:18:04.976
This love is just a dream for a few days.

00:18:06.403 --> 00:18:08.183
Life is very long.

00:18:09.245 --> 00:18:10.396
There is a lot in it.

00:18:11.534 --> 00:18:14.512
And love is of no use there.

00:18:16.103 --> 00:18:17.465
Father, this is my life.

00:18:17.767 --> 00:18:19.885
You let me take the decisions of my life.

00:18:21.145 --> 00:18:21.856
Fine.

00:18:22.830 --> 00:18:23.830
Tell Adil.

00:18:24.896 --> 00:18:26.016
And go with Raja.

00:18:30.652 --> 00:18:31.332
Adil?

00:18:33.414 --> 00:18:34.076
Yes.

00:18:34.850 --> 00:18:36.770
Will you tell him or should I go and tell
him?

00:18:43.815 --> 00:18:45.242
I am giving you one last chance.

00:18:47.140 --> 00:18:48.400
Think about it again.

00:19:12.093 --> 00:19:12.922
Listen to me, Amir.

00:19:14.951 --> 00:19:15.662
Is the work done?

00:19:17.997 --> 00:19:20.608
Did you give Sara's divorce to Asifa?

00:19:23.291 --> 00:19:23.811
No.

00:19:25.426 --> 00:19:26.493
What do you mean by no?

00:19:27.034 --> 00:19:28.656
You left because of this, right?

00:19:28.680 --> 00:19:29.404
What is this now?

00:19:30.848 --> 00:19:32.942
Why didn't you break Asifa's pride?

00:19:34.830 --> 00:19:35.453
Mother..

00:19:36.842 --> 00:19:38.171
I... I won't be able to do this.

00:19:41.897 --> 00:19:43.111
Why won't you be able to do this?

00:19:43.760 --> 00:19:45.333
Why are you saying such 
unmanly things?

00:19:46.971 --> 00:19:51.346
Did you meet your dear wife?

00:19:51.740 --> 00:19:53.260
She must have made you fall in love with
her.

00:19:53.341 --> 00:19:54.704
She must have brought you under her
spell.

00:19:55.701 --> 00:19:59.395
Mom, I told you that I can't divorce her.

00:20:00.555 --> 00:20:01.542
Why can't you?

00:20:03.082 --> 00:20:05.413
Because she is going to be my child's
mother.

00:20:23.088 --> 00:20:24.411
Saba... Saba?

00:20:25.295 --> 00:20:25.833
Saba?

00:20:34.273 --> 00:20:35.073
Saba?

00:20:35.760 --> 00:20:37.197
Saba, open the door.

00:20:38.404 --> 00:20:40.746
Saba, open the door and listen to me.

00:20:40.944 --> 00:20:43.046
I don't want to listen to anyone.

00:20:43.302 --> 00:20:44.400
Leave me alone.

00:20:44.424 --> 00:20:45.393
Go away from here.

00:20:47.404 --> 00:20:48.622
Okay, open the door.

00:20:49.706 --> 00:20:51.382
Look, don't hurt yourself like this.

00:20:51.799 --> 00:20:53.111
This is my pain.

00:20:53.473 --> 00:20:56.039
Let me be alone in this pain.

00:20:58.679 --> 00:21:01.651
And tell brother to congratulate him on
his love.

00:21:02.368 --> 00:21:03.528
Let me die.

00:21:07.042 --> 00:21:08.471
What should I have told you?

00:21:10.814 --> 00:21:11.893
How would I have told you?

00:21:13.971 --> 00:21:16.777
Did you leave any room 
for me tell you?

00:21:18.648 --> 00:21:20.126
You threatened to divorce me.

00:21:21.425 --> 00:21:23.697
Okay, please leave all this.

00:21:24.428 --> 00:21:25.882
What did the doctor say?

00:21:27.879 --> 00:21:31.359
The doctor said that there is a routine
checkup.

00:21:32.742 --> 00:21:33.742
I will go.

00:21:34.228 --> 00:21:36.446
I will take you to the doctor myself.

00:21:39.138 --> 00:21:41.356
And will aunt give you the permission to come?

00:21:41.993 --> 00:21:42.993
What is wrong with you?

00:21:44.060 --> 00:21:45.395
I will talk to mother.

00:21:45.800 --> 00:21:46.840
She will not say anything.

00:21:47.640 --> 00:21:52.717
And I will have to do all this for you and
for my child.

00:21:52.741 --> 00:21:53.412
Who else is there for us?

00:22:01.020 --> 00:22:03.846
Okay, you open the door.

00:22:04.404 --> 00:22:05.684
Then I will talk to you.

00:22:06.542 --> 00:22:09.528
No one will have any problem because of
me.

00:22:11.260 --> 00:22:13.104
I am ending my pain.

00:22:20.331 --> 00:22:21.019
Saba?

00:22:21.711 --> 00:22:22.293
Saba?

00:22:25.646 --> 00:22:27.086
Saba, open the door.

00:22:28.968 --> 00:22:29.768
Saba?

00:22:33.317 --> 00:22:34.157
Amir?

00:22:34.799 --> 00:22:35.535
Amir?

00:22:35.680 --> 00:22:36.020
Mother?

00:22:36.080 --> 00:22:36.555
Amir?

00:22:36.700 --> 00:22:37.700
What happened?

00:22:38.035 --> 00:22:38.675
Saba.

00:22:38.811 --> 00:22:40.415
What happened to Saba?

00:22:40.810 --> 00:22:42.977
Saba locked herself in her room.

00:22:43.001 --> 00:22:43.521
I am scared.

00:22:43.940 --> 00:22:45.256
She will do something to herself.  

00:22:45.280 --> 00:22:46.235
Come with me.

00:22:47.580 --> 00:22:48.580
Saba?

00:22:49.762 --> 00:22:50.544
Saba?

00:22:51.337 --> 00:22:52.257
Saba?

00:23:02.311 --> 00:23:04.746
Saba, what have you done?

00:23:05.120 --> 00:23:06.320
Saba, come to your senses.

00:23:06.540 --> 00:23:08.351
Saba, Saba, come to your senses.

00:23:08.375 --> 00:23:09.019
Saba.

00:23:09.442 --> 00:23:10.897
Amir, look at her.

00:23:13.080 --> 00:23:14.280
Come to your senses, my child.

00:23:14.491 --> 00:23:16.759
Saba, come to your senses.

00:23:17.255 --> 00:23:19.195
Saba, come to your senses, my child.

00:23:24.333 --> 00:23:25.493
Talked to Amir?

00:23:34.107 --> 00:23:36.958
He is saying that he will talk to aunt.

00:23:40.176 --> 00:23:41.536
Okay, okay.

00:23:42.196 --> 00:23:43.656
God will do good.

00:23:45.056 --> 00:23:45.958
Mother, what happened?

00:23:46.310 --> 00:23:47.310
What happened to you?

00:23:49.254 --> 00:23:52.143
I am worried about Raja.

00:23:52.829 --> 00:23:54.392
He has left early in the morning.

00:23:56.334 --> 00:23:59.016
There is no news about him.

00:23:59.798 --> 00:24:01.698
And Rania's father came yesterday.

00:24:03.545 --> 00:24:05.961
He will never let these two get married.

00:24:10.844 --> 00:24:12.760
I don't know how my child will be.

00:24:12.786 --> 00:24:14.217
I hope everything is fine.

00:24:15.411 --> 00:24:16.500
I will find out.

00:24:16.524 --> 00:24:17.337
Yes, find out.

00:24:17.939 --> 00:24:18.824
Hurry up.

00:24:19.504 --> 00:24:20.773
Don't worry, mother.

00:24:21.220 --> 00:24:22.220
Everything will be fine.

00:24:24.675 --> 00:24:25.670
Look, Raja.

00:24:25.939 --> 00:24:27.433
I have done my work.

00:24:27.840 --> 00:24:29.502
You are the one who is getting late.

00:24:35.009 --> 00:24:35.906
How much time do we have?

00:24:37.246 --> 00:24:39.828
The admissions will be over.

00:24:40.584 --> 00:24:44.135
Once the date is over, then we will not go
anywhere for six to eight months.

00:24:46.222 --> 00:24:48.773
The sooner you hurry, the easier it will
be.

00:24:50.340 --> 00:24:51.188
I will do something.

00:24:54.000 --> 00:24:54.613
What happened?

00:24:58.384 --> 00:24:59.384
Is there any problem?

00:25:00.904 --> 00:25:02.006
Is the girl not agreeing?

00:25:03.670 --> 00:25:05.699
No, her family is not agreeing.

00:25:06.513 --> 00:25:10.242
As far as I remember, were you not running
away and getting married in court.

00:25:10.671 --> 00:25:13.071
How did her family get involved in this?

00:25:15.708 --> 00:25:17.913
She made a mistake with her family.

00:25:18.955 --> 00:25:20.031
What did she do now?

00:25:23.368 --> 00:25:26.171
She talked to her family at her home.

00:25:27.587 --> 00:25:28.609
Then they are having a meeting.

00:25:28.633 --> 00:25:29.195
You know that.

00:25:32.614 --> 00:25:33.997
This is a big mistake.

00:25:35.064 --> 00:25:38.802
Now, what do you want to do?

00:25:40.833 --> 00:25:44.551
Should I give you advice as a brother 
or should I talk to you as an agent?

00:25:47.975 --> 00:25:49.788
I have talked to you as an agent all my
life.

00:25:50.499 --> 00:25:52.006
Now give me advice.

00:25:54.208 --> 00:25:58.877
So, the thing is, Mr. Raja, that going to
London was your dream.

00:25:59.266 --> 00:25:59.875
Isn't it?

00:26:00.735 --> 00:26:02.688
I was the one who put the girl in between.

00:26:04.864 --> 00:26:06.764
But now your dream has changed.

00:26:07.379 --> 00:26:09.177
Now this girl is your dream.

00:26:10.051 --> 00:26:12.064
And I am the one putting London in
between.

00:26:14.311 --> 00:26:15.284
Listen to me.

00:26:16.162 --> 00:26:19.555
For now, focus on the girl and not on the
London.

00:26:20.353 --> 00:26:21.453
Marry her.

00:26:24.535 --> 00:26:26.268
I am telling you, this is very important.

00:26:26.642 --> 00:26:29.577
If you don't go to London, you won't die.

00:26:30.177 --> 00:26:34.004
But, if you don't get this
girl, then whatever your

00:26:34.029 --> 00:26:37.686
condition is, my brother,
you will definitely die.

00:26:38.986 --> 00:26:40.595
Get Rania.

00:26:41.244 --> 00:26:42.244
Get Rania.

00:26:50.777 --> 00:26:51.532
Yes, Wajjo.

00:26:53.080 --> 00:26:53.484
What?

00:26:57.433 --> 00:26:57.904
I am coming.

00:26:57.928 --> 00:26:58.681
I am coming.

00:26:58.817 --> 00:26:59.148
Be patient.

00:26:59.640 --> 00:27:00.257
What happened?

00:27:00.482 --> 00:27:01.036
Nothing.

00:27:01.060 --> 00:27:01.500
I will tell you later.

00:27:01.606 --> 00:27:02.290
At least tell me and go.

00:27:02.315 --> 00:27:03.315
What happened?

00:27:16.723 --> 00:27:18.116
I am a girl's father.

00:27:20.128 --> 00:27:25.855
And I don't think it is appropriate for me
to say anything like this.

00:27:27.818 --> 00:27:28.578
But what can I do?

00:27:29.291 --> 00:27:29.966
I am a father.

00:27:31.660 --> 00:27:32.926
I can understand.

00:27:34.040 --> 00:27:35.146
I am also a mother.

00:27:36.595 --> 00:27:37.855
You talk openly.

00:27:37.880 --> 00:27:39.293
I will listen to you.

00:27:41.660 --> 00:27:44.306
Rania and Adil have got engaged.

00:27:46.116 --> 00:27:48.269
And we haven't told anyone about that yet.

00:27:50.884 --> 00:27:52.119
We are the girl's family.

00:27:53.202 --> 00:27:54.984
Proposals come to the girl's family.

00:27:56.732 --> 00:27:58.320
And Rania is also getting proposals.

00:28:01.817 --> 00:28:06.084
I want us to get them married.

00:28:09.588 --> 00:28:10.322
Right now?

00:28:11.920 --> 00:28:12.377
Yes.

00:28:13.711 --> 00:28:14.884
I have another daughter.

00:28:15.868 --> 00:28:17.793
I have to think about her too.

00:28:22.573 --> 00:28:23.324
Fine.

00:28:26.813 --> 00:28:28.115
I can understand what you are saying.

00:28:32.150 --> 00:28:34.374
I will talk to Adil when he comes home.

00:28:36.392 --> 00:28:37.798
He has got engaged.

00:28:38.545 --> 00:28:39.856
So he will definitely get married.

00:28:41.994 --> 00:28:43.209
You don't worry.

00:28:44.730 --> 00:28:45.321
Thank you.

00:28:50.490 --> 00:28:51.685
What is going on?

00:28:52.303 --> 00:28:53.063
Where are you busy?

00:28:53.087 --> 00:28:54.385
I don't know anything about you.

00:28:55.274 --> 00:28:56.385
I had told you.

00:28:57.070 --> 00:28:58.630
I was busy in my friend's wedding.

00:28:59.741 --> 00:29:01.269
I had sent you pictures too.

00:29:03.196 --> 00:29:04.523
Yes, I had seen them.

00:29:05.270 --> 00:29:07.034
Yesterday you were wearing my favorite.

00:29:08.321 --> 00:29:10.921
Do you know what was the best part?

00:29:11.544 --> 00:29:13.947
The protocol you had sent for my car in
the wedding.

00:29:14.104 --> 00:29:14.971
It was the best.

00:29:16.492 --> 00:29:18.292
Anyway, tell me.

00:29:18.352 --> 00:29:20.032
How far has your sister's wedding reached?

00:29:21.134 --> 00:29:22.354
Right now it is stuck.

00:29:23.292 --> 00:29:25.269
There is a separation in love.

00:29:25.872 --> 00:29:27.514
And Rania herself told father.

00:29:27.998 --> 00:29:29.812
Raja got beaten up a lot too.

00:29:30.994 --> 00:29:32.083
He is locked in the room.

00:29:33.996 --> 00:29:35.281
This is what happens in love.

00:29:36.072 --> 00:29:39.018
Anger, beating, separation.

00:29:39.905 --> 00:29:40.985
This is the beauty of love.

00:29:42.718 --> 00:29:43.098
Okay.

00:29:43.190 --> 00:29:43.550
Tell me.

00:29:43.551 --> 00:29:44.551
Has father come to you?

00:29:46.836 --> 00:29:47.761
Yes, maybe.

00:29:49.205 --> 00:29:50.184
I will call you back.

00:29:50.545 --> 00:29:51.056
Okay.

00:29:54.530 --> 00:29:55.454
Has Mr. Mirza come?

00:29:57.190 --> 00:29:58.190
Yes.

00:29:59.012 --> 00:29:59.892
He has gone.

00:30:01.213 --> 00:30:02.213
He was very upset.

00:30:03.910 --> 00:30:09.501
He was insisting a lot that Adil and Rania
should get married now.

00:30:14.831 --> 00:30:16.439
He found out about Raja.

00:30:17.984 --> 00:30:19.879
That is why he is forcing Rania.

00:30:22.693 --> 00:30:23.342
Yes.

00:30:24.624 --> 00:30:25.864
It is obvious.

00:30:26.966 --> 00:30:30.497
Adil Sultan is getting out of his hands.

00:30:31.793 --> 00:30:33.468
He will force his way.

00:30:35.688 --> 00:30:37.428
But we have to decide.

00:30:41.912 --> 00:30:48.438
That Rania will get married to Adil or to
that Raja.

00:30:50.734 --> 00:30:51.618
Adil is coming.

00:30:52.829 --> 00:30:54.772
We have to prepare for his welcome.

00:30:58.425 --> 00:30:59.425
So much change?

00:31:00.890 --> 00:31:01.347
You?

00:31:02.230 --> 00:31:03.781
Will you welcome Adil?

00:31:06.356 --> 00:31:07.410
I will not welcome him.

00:31:08.030 --> 00:31:08.847
Someone else will.

00:31:22.855 --> 00:31:25.464
What have you done?

00:31:26.914 --> 00:31:28.785
What if something had happened to you?

00:31:29.852 --> 00:31:31.424
Anything could have happened.

00:31:31.448 --> 00:31:33.439
Amir wouldn't have been at home.

00:31:34.102 --> 00:31:36.378
You wouldn't have been able to reach the
hospital on time.

00:31:36.402 --> 00:31:37.022
God forbid.

00:31:37.200 --> 00:31:37.760
God forbid.

00:31:37.880 --> 00:31:39.084
I would have died.

00:31:39.375 --> 00:31:43.518
If something had happened to you, what
would have happened to Naheed and Jamil?

00:31:43.884 --> 00:31:44.813
Have you ever thought about it?

00:31:47.723 --> 00:31:50.337
Whatever would have happened to me,
would have happened to my family.

00:31:51.213 --> 00:31:55.275
It doesn't matter to you whether I am
alive or not.

00:31:57.700 --> 00:31:59.871
You are talking like a fool.

00:32:02.060 --> 00:32:07.011
You are as dear to me as Raja and Saira.

00:32:07.400 --> 00:32:11.291
I would have been as sad as your parents
would have been.

00:32:12.895 --> 00:32:14.608
This is just something to say.

00:32:14.784 --> 00:32:17.664
If this had happened, you would have
thought about me.

00:32:18.104 --> 00:32:19.926
But you only thought about Rania.

00:32:19.984 --> 00:32:21.139
You supported her.

00:32:24.604 --> 00:32:25.686
This is not true.

00:32:25.746 --> 00:32:27.084
You are wrong.

00:32:27.984 --> 00:32:29.819
I have heard everything from my ears.

00:32:31.786 --> 00:32:36.179
Look Saba, I want to see you and Raja
happy.

00:32:36.680 --> 00:32:37.900
Both of you are my children.

00:32:38.920 --> 00:32:40.288
Raja is with Rani.

00:32:41.020 --> 00:32:42.020
This is my happiness?

00:32:42.386 --> 00:32:43.995
This is what you have done for me?

00:32:45.135 --> 00:32:46.439
You knew everything.

00:32:46.717 --> 00:32:49.319
You knew that I love Raja.

00:32:49.925 --> 00:32:52.799
Even after that, you ignored me.

00:32:58.711 --> 00:33:03.126
I... I wanted you to marry Raja
with my heart.

00:33:03.757 --> 00:33:05.268
I tried.

00:33:06.031 --> 00:33:08.827
But... Tell me, what
would I have done?

00:33:09.460 --> 00:33:11.422
His happiness was with Rania.

00:33:13.535 --> 00:33:16.891
I couldn't force you into his heart.

00:33:18.606 --> 00:33:25.237
And anyway, even if I had forced him,
you would have never been happy with him.

00:33:27.211 --> 00:33:28.211
Think for yourself.

00:33:28.615 --> 00:33:32.902
How will someone else be happy with
someone else?

00:33:34.017 --> 00:33:35.997
You should have gotten me married.

00:33:37.011 --> 00:33:38.377
I want Raja.

00:33:38.401 --> 00:33:40.375
He would have fallen in love with me. 

00:33:40.400 --> 00:33:41.795
He would have forgotten Rani.

00:33:42.340 --> 00:33:44.240
My love would have changed him.

00:33:44.870 --> 00:33:46.420
No, no, no.

00:33:46.421 --> 00:33:48.136
You are talking emotional.

00:33:48.515 --> 00:33:50.648
You would have never been happy with him.

00:33:51.195 --> 00:33:53.035
You would have been in pain.

00:33:53.060 --> 00:33:55.488
A pain that would never end.

00:33:58.344 --> 00:34:00.761
I am trying to make you understand as a
daughter.

00:34:01.348 --> 00:34:05.484
The one who cannot be yours, stop showing
your right on him.

00:34:10.451 --> 00:34:17.570
These possessions, they are lands, shops,
plots , they are on this, not on the hearts.

00:34:22.177 --> 00:34:22.978
Did you understand?

00:34:24.145 --> 00:34:27.113
You, find your happiness in such a place
where it values you.

00:34:27.866 --> 00:34:30.336
What will you get by running after those
who don't value you?

00:34:30.360 --> 00:34:31.360
Leave all this.

00:34:33.085 --> 00:34:35.446
And you are such a good girl.

00:34:35.470 --> 00:34:38.230
There should be someone very good in your
fate.

